        {
          "alias": false,
          "_styles": {
            "padding-top": "(@paddingTop * 1rem)",
            "padding-bottom": "(@paddingBottom * 1rem)",
            "& when (@bg-type = 'color')": {
              "background-color": "@bg-value"
            },
            "& when (@bg-type = 'image')": {
              "background-image": "url(@bg-value)"
            },
            "& when (@reverseContent)": {
              ".row": {
                "flex-direction": "row-reverse"
              }
            },
            ".mbr-text": {
              "color": "#000000"
            },
            ".mbr-section-subtitle": {
              "color": "#000000",
              "text-align": "center"
            },
            ".mbr-section-title": {
              "color": "#000000",
              "text-align": "left"
            },
            ".mbr-section-subtitle, .main-button": {
              "text-align": "left",
              "color": "#000000"
            },
            ".main-button": {
              "margin-bottom": "2rem",
              "@media (max-width: 767px)": {
                "margin-bottom": "2rem"
              }
            },
            ".mbr-iconfont": {
              "font-size": "1.2rem !important",
              "font-family": "'Moririse2' !important",
              "color": "white",
              "transition": "all 0.3s",
              "transform": "rotate(180deg)",
              "padding-left": "0.5rem"
            },
            ".panel-group": {
              "border": "none"
            },
            ".card-header": {
              "padding": "0rem",
              "@media (max-width: 767px)": {
                "padding": "0rem"
              }
            },
            ".panel-body": {
              "padding": "0rem",
              "padding-bottom": "0.5rem",
              "margin-top": "1rem"
            },
            ".collapsed": {
              "span": {
                "transform": "rotate(0deg)"
              }
            },
            ".panel-title": {
              "display": "flex",
              "align-items": "center",
              "justify-content": "space-between"
            },
            "p": {
              "margin-bottom": "0.3rem"
            },
            ".panel-title-edit": {
              "color": "#000000"
            },
            ".card .card-header": {
              "background-color": "transparent",
              "margin-bottom": "0",
              "border": "0",
              "border-radius": "2rem"
            },
            ".card": {
              "background": "@items",
              "padding": "2.25rem",
              "margin-bottom": "1rem",
              "@media (max-width: 767px)": {
                "padding": "2rem 1.5rem",
                "margin-bottom": "1rem"
              },
              "@media (min-width: 992px) and (max-width: 1200px)": {
                "margin-bottom": "1rem",
                "padding": "2rem 1.5rem"
              }
            },
            ".panel-text": {
              "color": "#000000"
            },
            ".panel-title-edit, .mbr-iconfont": {
              "color": "#000000"
            }
          },
          "_name": "list07",
          "_sourceTheme": "startm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"list07\" group=\"Features\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-fullscreen': fullScreen,'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"reverseContent\" title=\"Reverse\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"6\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"6\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"showButton\" title=\"Buttons\">\n        <select title=\"Questions\" name=\"cardAmount\">\n            <option value=\"1\">1</option>\n            <option value=\"2\">2</option>\n            <option value=\"3\">3</option>\n            <option value=\"4\">4</option>\n            <option value=\"5\">5</option>\n            <option value=\"6\" selected>6</option>\n        </select>\n        <header>Color</header>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Item\" name=\"items\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"../_images/background1.jpg\">\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#edefeb\" selected>\n        </fieldset>\n        <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n        <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"../_images/background1.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.7\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\"></div>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"col-lg-4\">\n                <div class=\"col-12 col-md-12\">\n                    <h5 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\">\n                        <b>FAQ</b></h5>\n                    <h6 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle, .main-button\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\"></h6>\n                    <div class=\"mbr-section-btn item-footer mt-3  main-button\" mbr-if=\"showButton\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove,-mbrBtnAdd\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">\n                        <a href class=\"btn item-btn btn-primary\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Learn More</a>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"col-lg-8\">\n                <div id=\"bootstrap-accordion\" class=\"panel-group accordionStyles accordion\" role=\"tablist\" aria-multiselectable=\"true\">\n                    <div class=\"card\">\n                        <div class=\"card-header\" role=\"tab\" id=\"headingOne\">\n                            <a role=\"button\" class=\"panel-title collapsed\" data-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-core href=\"#collapse1\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"collapse1\">\n                                <h6 class=\"panel-title-edit mbr-semibold mbr-fonts-style mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".panel-title-edit, .mbr-iconfont\">\n                                    如何预约拍摄？流程是怎样的？\n                                </h6>\n                                <span class=\"sign mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-arrow-down\"></span>\n                            </a>\n                        </div>\n                        <div id=\"collapse1\" class=\"panel-collapse noScroll collapse\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"headingOne\" data-parent=\"#accordion\" data-bs-parent=\"#accordion\">\n                            <div class=\"panel-body\">\n                                <p class=\"mbr-fonts-style panel-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".panel-text\">预约非常简单！您可以通过网站的联系表单、信息或电话联系我。我们的基本流程是：\n<br>\n<br>1. 沟通需求：我们会先聊聊您的想法、拍摄风格和预算。\n<br>\n<br>2. 确定细节：敲定拍摄日期、地点和具体套餐，并支付定金以预留档期。\n<br>\n<br>3. 拍摄日：享受愉快的拍摄过程即可！\n<br>\n<br>4. 选片与交付：拍摄后，我会给您预览图进行挑选，精修完成后交付所有成品。</p>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"card\" mbr-if=\"cardAmount > 1\">\n                        <div class=\"card-header\" role=\"tab\" id=\"headingOne\">\n                            <a role=\"button\" class=\"panel-title collapsed\" data-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-core href=\"#collapse2\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"collapse2\">\n                                <h6 class=\"panel-title-edit mbr-semibold mbr-fonts-style mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".panel-title-edit\">\n                                    拍摄前我们需要做哪些准备？\n                                </h6>\n                                <span class=\"sign mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-arrow-down\"></span>\n                            </a>\n                        </div>\n                        <div id=\"collapse2\" class=\"panel-collapse noScroll collapse\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"headingOne\" data-parent=\"#accordion\" data-bs-parent=\"#accordion\">\n                            <div class=\"panel-body\">\n                                <p class=\"mbr-fonts-style panel-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".panel-text\">\n                                    别担心，在确定拍摄后，我会为您提供一份详细的《拍摄准备指南》。它会根据您的拍摄类型（婚纱/家庭/个人）包含服装建议、道具 ideas、以及注意事项等，帮助您轻松做好准备。\n                                </p>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"card\" mbr-if=\"cardAmount > 2\">\n                        <div class=\"card-header\" role=\"tab\" id=\"headingOne\">\n                            <a role=\"button\" class=\"panel-title collapsed\" data-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-core href=\"#collapse3\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"collapse3\">\n                                <h6 class=\"panel-title-edit mbr-semibold mbr-fonts-style mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".panel-title-edit\">\n                                    如果拍摄当天天气不好怎么办？\n                                </h6>\n                                <span class=\"sign mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-arrow-down\"></span>\n                            </a>\n                        </div>\n                        <div id=\"collapse3\" class=\"panel-collapse noScroll collapse\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"headingOne\" data-parent=\"#accordion\" data-bs-parent=\"#accordion\">\n                            <div class=\"panel-body\">\n                                <p class=\"mbr-fonts-style panel-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".panel-text\">\n                                    对于室外拍摄，我会密切关注天气情况。如果遇到不理想的天气（如大雨、暴晒等），我们会提前沟通，协商改期或转为室内拍摄。您的体验和成片效果是我们的首要考虑。\n                                </p>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"card\" mbr-if=\"cardAmount > 3\">\n                        <div class=\"card-header\" role=\"tab\" id=\"headingOne\">\n                            <a role=\"button\" class=\"panel-title collapsed\" data-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-core href=\"#collapse4\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"collapse4\">\n                                <h6 class=\"panel-title-edit mbr-semibold mbr-fonts-style mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".panel-title-edit\">\n                                    可以指定拍摄地点吗？旅拍的费用如何计算？\n                                </h6>\n                                <span class=\"sign mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-arrow-down\"></span>\n                            </a>\n                        </div>\n                        <div id=\"collapse4\" class=\"panel-collapse noScroll collapse\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"headingOne\" data-parent=\"#accordion\" data-bs-parent=\"#accordion\">\n                            <div class=\"panel-body\">\n                                <p class=\"mbr-fonts-style panel-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".panel-text\">当然可以！我非常欢迎您提出心仪的拍摄地点。无论是本市的某个公园还是异地旅拍，我们都可以共同策划。<br>\n<br>旅拍的费用通常包含我的交通、住宿和拍摄服务费。具体方案我们会根据目的地和行程为您量身定制。</p>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"card\" mbr-if=\"cardAmount > 4\">\n                        <div class=\"card-header\" role=\"tab\" id=\"headingOne\">\n                            <a role=\"button\" class=\"panel-title collapsed\" data-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-core href=\"#collapse5\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"collapse5\">\n                                <h6 class=\"panel-title-edit mbr-semibold mbr-fonts-style mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".panel-title-edit\">\n                                    底片会全部给我们吗？精修是什么意思？\n                                </h6>\n                                <span class=\"sign mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-arrow-down\"></span>\n                            </a>\n                        </div>\n                        <div id=\"collapse5\" class=\"panel-collapse noScroll collapse\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"headingOne\" data-parent=\"#accordion\" data-bs-parent=\"#accordion\">\n                            <div class=\"panel-body\">\n                                <p class=\"mbr-fonts-style panel-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".panel-text\">是的，在所有套餐中，您都会收到所有拍摄底片（经过初步调色）。\n<br>“精修”是在此基础上，对您选定的照片进行更深度的处理，比如精细修饰皮肤、调整光影色调、去除穿帮杂物等，让照片更具质感。精修张数根据您选择的套餐而定。</p>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"card\" mbr-if=\"cardAmount > 5\">\n                        <div class=\"card-header\" role=\"tab\" id=\"headingOne\">\n                            <a role=\"button\" class=\"panel-title collapsed\" data-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-core href=\"#collapse6\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"collapse6\">\n                                <h6 class=\"panel-title-edit mbr-semibold mbr-fonts-style mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".panel-title-edit\">\n                                    拍摄过程中可以指导我们摆姿势吗？我们不太会拍照有点紧张。\n                                </h6>\n                                <span class=\"sign mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-arrow-down\"></span>\n                            </a>\n                        </div>\n                        <div id=\"collapse6\" class=\"panel-collapse noScroll collapse\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"headingOne\" data-parent=\"#accordion\" data-bs-parent=\"#accordion\">\n                            <div class=\"panel-body\">\n                                <p class=\"mbr-fonts-style panel-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".panel-text\">\n                                    请完全放心！绝大多数客户都不是专业模特。我的拍摄方式就是引导而非摆拍。我会通过简单的指令和互动，帮助你们放松下来，捕捉你们最自然的状态和情感流露。您只需要享受过程，剩下的交给我。\n                                </p>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
          "_cid": "uWCevg0uCL",
          "_anchor": "list07-y",
          "_protectedParams": [],
          "_global": false,
          "_once": false,
          "_params": {}
        },
        {
          "alias": false,
          "_styles": {
            "padding-top": "(@paddingTop * 1rem)",
